108 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 79 0 R
/E (3D Bharat is a unified digital platform developed for the planning, design, measurement, execution, and monitoring of construction and infrastructure projects. It integrates 3D modeling, field data collection, and drone-based imagery to provide a complete and accurate representation of project progress. It also incorporates Digital Twin technology along with IoT, GNSS RTX, and GPS-based solutions to enable real-time data synchronization, high-precision positioning, and intelligent project monitoring.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
